WEBVTT

00:33.580 --> 00:37.020
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.325 --> 00:39.837
=Episode 17=

00:39.885 --> 00:42.600
(Mother-in-Law, I'm Coming!)

00:42.987 --> 00:49.162
(Wei Mansion)

00:49.799 --> 00:51.279
Farewell, Your Highness.

00:52.160 --> 00:52.960
Sis Luo,

00:53.000 --> 00:54.160
sorry to bother you this time.

00:54.599 --> 00:55.400
Sis?

00:56.000 --> 00:57.230
That messes up the generations, no?

00:57.240 --> 00:57.880
It's fine.

00:58.320 --> 00:59.199
Your Highness,

00:59.199 --> 01:01.320
you are welcome to visit
often whenever you're free.

01:01.320 --> 01:02.000
All right.

01:02.000 --> 01:04.320
Then I'll surely be bothering you
much more in the future.

01:05.000 --> 01:06.440
(Is she always this polite?)

01:06.920 --> 01:07.719
Girl,

01:08.519 --> 01:09.760
the way you're acting

01:11.120 --> 01:12.039
is too fake.

01:12.480 --> 01:13.600
It's called etiquette.

01:13.719 --> 01:14.760
Come on.

01:18.000 --> 01:19.000
Safe travels.

01:27.937 --> 01:30.475
♪The copper pot brews
through the midnight moon♪

01:30.612 --> 01:33.637
♪Iced milk tea enters the mortal realm♪

01:36.000 --> 01:37.640
Who am I ever afraid of?

01:37.799 --> 01:39.280
But you are my bottom line.

01:39.280 --> 01:39.960
I...

01:39.960 --> 01:42.079
I'm wearing a mask
because I don't want to upset her.

01:42.150 --> 01:43.537
♪The glazed cup reflects
a face like peach blossoms♪

01:43.560 --> 01:45.870
Your Highness went to see
Young Master Wei looking so worried,

01:45.880 --> 01:47.680
but you came out in a great mood.

01:47.690 --> 01:50.640
Does Young Master Wei really have
a way to help Your Highness out of this?

01:51.159 --> 01:53.040
What could the fool do?

01:53.079 --> 01:54.719
I'm lucky if he doesn't just annoy me.

01:54.840 --> 01:55.480
True.

01:55.640 --> 01:57.640
Wei the Fool is always so unreliable.

01:57.680 --> 01:58.959
He's never serious all day.

01:59.319 --> 02:00.120
He speaks recklessly

02:00.120 --> 02:01.390
and is always getting into fights.

02:01.400 --> 02:03.190
He really isn't a good match
for Your Highness.

02:03.319 --> 02:05.200
He does have many flaws.

02:05.599 --> 02:06.280
But

02:06.719 --> 02:08.560
that's what makes him a real person,
isn't it?

02:09.480 --> 02:10.560
Wei the Fool

02:10.680 --> 02:12.439
is flighty with the small things,

02:12.450 --> 02:13.879
but when it comes to the big things,

02:13.920 --> 02:15.599
he has never once faltered.

02:16.159 --> 02:17.719
Everything I entrust to him,

02:17.799 --> 02:19.040
he manages to get done.

02:19.519 --> 02:20.439
Whatever he says,

02:20.640 --> 02:22.319
he always stands by his word.

02:22.519 --> 02:24.439
Compared to the hypocrisy of others,

02:24.719 --> 02:27.079
I much prefer his blunt honesty.

02:27.840 --> 02:28.640
At least

02:28.840 --> 02:30.719
he won't be like other young masters,

02:30.920 --> 02:33.120
flirting with every girl out there.

02:33.560 --> 02:34.879
He won't go out messing around,

02:35.239 --> 02:37.799
much less do anything treasonous.

02:41.400 --> 02:43.400
(Could it be that I already...)

02:48.319 --> 02:50.959
Send someone to
the Ministry of Revenue to investigate

02:51.439 --> 02:52.479
whether children

02:52.759 --> 02:54.080
born from inbreeding,

02:54.080 --> 02:55.439
such as cousin marriages,

02:56.000 --> 02:58.039
have a higher risk of deformities.

02:58.400 --> 03:00.840
Then, bring all the documents to me.

03:00.840 --> 03:01.639
Yes, Your Highness.

03:11.199 --> 03:13.159
His Majesty arrives.

03:14.039 --> 03:16.199
Are you worrying about Ning'an's matter?

03:16.759 --> 03:18.479
For the sake of Chong's marriage,

03:18.500 --> 03:20.330
my elder brother comes
to pay respects every day.

03:23.080 --> 03:24.000
About Ning'an,

03:24.560 --> 03:25.400
previously,

03:25.639 --> 03:27.599
I did indeed favor Zhangsun Chong.

03:28.120 --> 03:29.120
Regarding closeness,

03:29.120 --> 03:30.560
he is your biological nephew.

03:30.560 --> 03:31.599
We know him well.

03:31.960 --> 03:33.960
He certainly wouldn't
mistreat our daughter.

03:36.879 --> 03:38.000
In the past,

03:38.719 --> 03:40.560
I wouldn't have hesitated.

03:41.919 --> 03:43.039
But now,

03:43.840 --> 03:45.240
suddenly, there is

03:45.639 --> 03:47.719
this fool calling me "Father-in-law."

03:51.879 --> 03:54.039
Hao is indeed a good boy.

03:59.120 --> 04:00.319
You seem to value

04:01.240 --> 04:02.520
Wei the Fool quite highly.

04:02.680 --> 04:03.520
Why is that?

04:03.719 --> 04:04.879
Can't you tell

04:05.319 --> 04:07.719
Ning'an is very happy every day now?

04:08.759 --> 04:10.680
Even though she constantly complains

04:10.759 --> 04:12.240
that Wei the Fool has provoked her,

04:12.879 --> 04:15.080
she is happy every single day.

04:16.599 --> 04:18.240
In the past, within the palace,

04:18.439 --> 04:20.159
though she had many playmates,

04:21.000 --> 04:21.919
I...

04:21.919 --> 04:23.840
have never seen her this happy before.

04:25.159 --> 04:26.000
Additionally,

04:26.000 --> 04:28.690
Your Majesty, you have always
wanted to marry into the great clans,

04:29.039 --> 04:30.879
but they have never agreed to it.

04:31.560 --> 04:32.680
As for Wei Hao,

04:33.039 --> 04:34.879
he is indeed a breakthrough point now.

04:35.840 --> 04:37.120
Regarding this glaze incident,

04:37.639 --> 04:40.080
it's clear that Hao
is not afraid of the great clans.

04:41.000 --> 04:42.950
Even when dealing with
the Wei clan's interests,

04:42.960 --> 04:43.759
the way he handled it

04:43.759 --> 04:46.120
was nothing like those
clannish young masters.

04:47.800 --> 04:49.439
Besides, he has said before

04:50.000 --> 04:51.439
that he is willing to marry Ning'an.

04:51.919 --> 04:52.840
He is even willing

04:52.919 --> 04:55.280
to give her his entire
share of the workshop.

04:55.759 --> 04:56.840
Just think about it.

04:57.280 --> 04:59.319
If he weren't sincere toward Ning'an,

04:59.639 --> 05:01.759
would he be willing to
pay such a high price?

05:06.240 --> 05:07.839
As for him dating Ning'an,

05:08.360 --> 05:09.560
I don't object to it.

05:10.759 --> 05:11.560
First,

05:11.959 --> 05:14.000
he is a Marquis now,

05:14.319 --> 05:15.480
so it's acceptable.

05:15.839 --> 05:17.639
Plus, with the great clans
you mentioned,

05:17.879 --> 05:18.839
it's perfectly fine.

05:19.040 --> 05:22.040
But to say he has
the ability to protect Ning'an,

05:22.920 --> 05:24.199
well...

05:27.639 --> 05:28.560
Furthermore,

05:28.879 --> 05:29.920
this marriage

05:30.160 --> 05:32.680
also involves your maternal family,
the Zhangsuns.

05:33.279 --> 05:34.600
For Ning'an and Chong,

05:34.759 --> 05:36.800
it's always been an unspoken agreement.

05:38.519 --> 05:39.959
I don't mind much,

05:40.160 --> 05:41.399
but I'm afraid your brother

05:42.199 --> 05:43.360
will make things hard for you.

05:44.079 --> 05:45.920
Your Majesty needn't worry about me.

05:46.600 --> 05:49.600
I truly like Wei Hao.

05:50.399 --> 05:52.959
Marrying Ning'an to him
would put my mind at ease.

05:55.279 --> 05:56.079
Forget it.

05:56.399 --> 05:58.959
There's no rush to
decide this right now.

05:59.480 --> 06:00.160
However,

06:00.360 --> 06:01.279
as for your thoughts,

06:01.720 --> 06:03.120
I have a general idea now.

06:04.600 --> 06:06.512
(Juxian Restaurant)

06:09.360 --> 06:10.040
Mister Wang.

06:10.050 --> 06:11.040
Young Master, you're here.

06:11.040 --> 06:12.560
Why are there so many customers today?

06:12.800 --> 06:15.160
It's all because of the heater you made.

06:15.360 --> 06:17.000
Now all the customers are saying

06:17.000 --> 06:18.439
that eating here at Juxian Restaurant

06:18.480 --> 06:19.879
feels like a spring breeze.

06:20.120 --> 06:22.040
It's more comfortable
than staying at home.

06:22.439 --> 06:23.800
Not just our old regulars,

06:23.959 --> 06:26.879
even the new customers say
they won't go to any other restaurant.

06:27.279 --> 06:28.759
Well, that's a must.

06:29.330 --> 06:30.959
Young Master,
the upstairs has been cleared.

06:30.959 --> 06:32.800
They said the Crown Prince
is dining there.

06:35.480 --> 06:37.120
My brother-in-law is here?

06:37.680 --> 06:38.360
Perfect.

06:46.160 --> 06:47.319
- It's you.
- Mister Wei.

06:51.800 --> 06:52.720
Why didn't you tell me

06:52.720 --> 06:54.319
your hotpot was this delicious?

06:54.639 --> 06:56.120
Greetings, Brother-in-law.

06:57.360 --> 06:58.480
That title...

06:59.680 --> 07:00.199
Wait.

07:01.000 --> 07:02.040
What did you just call me?

07:02.040 --> 07:02.800
Brother-in-law.

07:03.879 --> 07:04.680
Hold on.

07:05.360 --> 07:06.319
What's that?

07:06.399 --> 07:07.720
Did you get it wrong?

07:08.399 --> 07:09.639
Didn't they tell you?

07:10.100 --> 07:11.920
Didn't my father-in-law
and Ning'an tell you?

07:12.319 --> 07:13.120
Ning'an?

07:13.839 --> 07:14.800
The Princess?

07:15.360 --> 07:16.360
My sister?

07:16.920 --> 07:17.800
Father-in-law?

07:18.079 --> 07:18.720
Yes.

07:19.199 --> 07:20.439
I already told my father-in-law,

07:20.639 --> 07:21.680
meaning His Majesty,

07:21.720 --> 07:22.959
about my feelings for Ning'an.

07:23.079 --> 07:24.279
I've met my parents-in-law.

07:24.280 --> 07:26.090
They didn't object
to my marriage to Ning'an.

07:27.959 --> 07:29.120
You didn't know this?

07:31.560 --> 07:32.519
That's impossible.

07:32.839 --> 07:34.920
Didn't my father-in-law tell you?

07:38.360 --> 07:39.160
Brother-in-law.

07:41.000 --> 07:41.800
Brother-in-law.

07:44.260 --> 07:44.959
Brother-in-law!

07:46.279 --> 07:46.720
I...

07:47.000 --> 07:48.040
How is that possible?

07:48.399 --> 07:49.120
Mister Wei,

07:49.120 --> 07:50.279
don't talk nonsense.

07:50.680 --> 07:52.759
If Father finds out, he'll kill you.

07:53.600 --> 07:54.399
Besides,

07:54.680 --> 07:55.759
how could my sister,

07:55.879 --> 07:57.000
Ning'an, marry you?

07:57.360 --> 07:57.720
Tsk.

07:57.720 --> 07:58.839
I'm not talking nonsense.

07:59.150 --> 08:00.759
I call them my parents-in-law every day.

08:00.759 --> 08:02.439
That means they've approved.

08:02.519 --> 08:03.319
Your Highness.

08:03.759 --> 08:04.079
You...

08:04.079 --> 08:04.680
Your Highness.

08:05.079 --> 08:07.240
Didn't I say not to disturb me
if there's nothing important?

08:07.240 --> 08:08.000
Your Highness,

08:08.000 --> 08:09.600
the Empress has sent a message

08:09.600 --> 08:10.959
inviting you and Marquis Wei

08:10.959 --> 08:12.480
to dine at Fengluan Palace.

08:15.439 --> 08:15.959
Fine.

08:16.279 --> 08:17.360
Go tell my mother-in-law

08:17.360 --> 08:18.199
that I'll come.

08:18.319 --> 08:19.839
Yes, Marquis Wei.

08:21.480 --> 08:22.000
Wait, no.

08:22.600 --> 08:22.959
No...

08:23.959 --> 08:24.800
Is this for real?

08:25.600 --> 08:26.480
That's right.

08:27.079 --> 08:29.040
I told my mother-in-law last time

08:29.120 --> 08:30.519
that I'd bring a gift when we met.

08:30.920 --> 08:32.480
It's already time for dinner,

08:32.560 --> 08:33.710
and I'm still empty-handed.

08:34.199 --> 08:34.879
Brother-in-law,

08:34.879 --> 08:35.680
I can't talk now.

08:35.680 --> 08:36.480
I've got to go.

08:38.160 --> 08:39.199
Wait a minute, Wei Hao.

08:39.310 --> 08:40.639
You haven't explained things yet.

08:40.639 --> 08:41.399
We'll talk later.

08:41.399 --> 08:42.680
I'm going to get
my mother-in-law's gift.

08:42.680 --> 08:43.639
Go back to Fengluan Palace first,

08:43.639 --> 08:44.839
and remember to let her know.

08:44.839 --> 08:45.199
I...

08:45.519 --> 08:45.879
I...

08:46.839 --> 08:49.040
(Sucking up to
my mother-in-law is what matters.)

08:49.439 --> 08:51.319
(As long as I play
my cards right with her,)

08:51.319 --> 08:52.240
(I'll have a massive)

08:52.240 --> 08:53.800
(safety net for the future.)

08:57.680 --> 09:00.040
Greetings to Father and Mother.

09:00.519 --> 09:01.800
Why are you alone?

09:02.040 --> 09:03.000
Where is Wei Hao?

09:03.319 --> 09:05.279
He said he went to get a gift for you,

09:05.399 --> 09:06.680
the one he promised last time.

09:08.160 --> 09:09.160
Come on...

09:09.600 --> 09:11.759
It would have been
fine to bring it next time.

09:12.199 --> 09:13.279
What kind of gift?

09:13.560 --> 09:15.200
I wouldn't know about that.

09:15.480 --> 09:16.240
Father,

09:16.440 --> 09:17.120
Mother,

09:17.720 --> 09:19.639
there's something I don't understand.

09:20.279 --> 09:22.360
About my sister and Wei Hao...

09:22.679 --> 09:24.039
Is that actually true?

09:24.559 --> 09:26.320
He keeps calling me his brother-in-law.

09:26.639 --> 09:28.519
No matter what I say, he won't stop.

09:28.720 --> 09:30.320
Calling you "Brother-in-law" is nothing.

09:30.840 --> 09:32.879
He even calls me his "Father-in-law."

09:34.639 --> 09:35.440
Enough.

09:35.480 --> 09:36.399
Let it be.

09:36.519 --> 09:38.399
He won't listen to your advice.

09:39.960 --> 09:40.480
Then...

09:41.399 --> 09:41.879
Wait, no.

09:42.000 --> 09:42.879
So it's true?

09:45.200 --> 09:46.720
As an older brother,

09:47.039 --> 09:49.200
you don't care about
your sister's affairs at all.

09:49.240 --> 09:50.879
No, Mother,

09:50.879 --> 09:52.440
how could I not care?

09:53.159 --> 09:55.600
I've just been too busy lately,

09:55.600 --> 09:57.120
reviewing memorials every day.

09:57.399 --> 09:59.440
I just never imagined
in my wildest dreams

09:59.720 --> 10:01.720
that Ning'an would like Wei the Fool.

10:04.039 --> 10:04.840
Father,

10:04.840 --> 10:05.639
Mother.

10:18.240 --> 10:20.480
What are you all discussing?

10:24.720 --> 10:27.039
Ning'an, how could you be so secretive?

10:27.279 --> 10:28.919
Hiding this from me?

10:29.559 --> 10:30.360
Hiding what?

10:30.440 --> 10:31.519
What is it?

10:31.639 --> 10:33.399
Your marriage to Wei the Fool.

10:33.960 --> 10:34.840
Gaoming,

10:34.919 --> 10:36.120
don't talk nonsense.

10:36.159 --> 10:37.060
There's no such thing.

10:37.279 --> 10:39.320
Nothing has been decided yet.

10:39.799 --> 10:40.600
Father,

10:40.919 --> 10:41.720
Mother.

10:41.800 --> 10:42.919
Look, she's getting flustered.

10:42.919 --> 10:44.440
"Nothing has been decided yet."

10:44.440 --> 10:45.360
Gaoming,

10:45.399 --> 10:46.320
stop talking nonsense.

10:46.440 --> 10:46.919
Stop it.

10:46.919 --> 10:47.890
You still won't admit it?

10:47.900 --> 10:48.799
Look how red your face is.

10:48.799 --> 10:50.279
Father and Mother are right here.

10:50.279 --> 10:50.679
You...

10:50.679 --> 10:51.840
Just marry him if you want to.

10:51.840 --> 10:53.039
Alright, that's enough.

10:53.799 --> 10:54.720
And you,

10:54.759 --> 10:56.519
you're not acting like a proper brother.

10:56.879 --> 10:58.320
Teasing your sister like that.

10:58.320 --> 10:59.720
You like him?

11:00.080 --> 11:01.279
If you like him, then fine.

11:01.600 --> 11:02.720
That's a good thing.

11:03.200 --> 11:04.000
Mother.

11:04.639 --> 11:05.559
Get out of here.

11:05.840 --> 11:08.039
If he ever dares to
bully my sister once,

11:08.320 --> 11:09.879
as his brother-in-law,

11:10.080 --> 11:11.399
I'll teach him a lesson.

11:13.000 --> 11:14.360
From my perspective,

11:14.559 --> 11:18.039
it will be your sister
bullying Wei Hao in the future.

11:19.080 --> 11:20.039
This girl...

11:20.080 --> 11:21.080
The way she acts

11:21.080 --> 11:22.480
around us compared to

11:22.480 --> 11:24.080
when she is with Wei Hao is different.

11:25.080 --> 11:26.399
But that is fine.

11:26.679 --> 11:28.919
It allows her to show her true self.

11:30.050 --> 11:31.519
Marquis Wei, please let me take that.

11:31.519 --> 11:31.879
It is fine.

11:31.879 --> 11:33.140
It is not heavy. I will do it myself.

11:33.159 --> 11:33.919
Marquis Wei,

11:33.919 --> 11:34.960
the Empress is inside.

11:34.960 --> 11:36.000
Let me announce your arrival.

11:36.000 --> 11:37.240
No need for the trouble.

11:37.440 --> 11:38.240
Mother-in-law.

11:38.360 --> 11:39.159
Mother-in-law.

11:40.120 --> 11:41.120
Mother-in-law, I am here.

11:41.240 --> 11:42.080
Good boy.

11:42.080 --> 11:42.919
Come on in.

11:43.710 --> 11:44.799
Greetings, Mother-in-law.

11:45.240 --> 11:45.919
Hey, Girl.

11:47.240 --> 11:48.120
Brother-in-law.

11:51.919 --> 11:52.559
Father-in-law,

11:52.960 --> 11:53.840
you are here too?

11:56.919 --> 11:58.600
What kind of gift
are you carrying there?

11:58.600 --> 11:59.320
Mother-in-law,

11:59.559 --> 12:00.679
this is some great stuff.

12:11.850 --> 12:14.680
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

12:15.300 --> 12:18.700
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

12:19.470 --> 12:22.420
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

12:22.760 --> 12:25.460
♪Sigh and walk away♪

12:27.060 --> 12:30.530
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

12:30.530 --> 12:32.760
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

12:32.760 --> 12:34.870
♪Colors and darkness♪

12:34.870 --> 12:36.890
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

12:36.890 --> 12:41.250
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

12:42.690 --> 12:46.420
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

12:46.690 --> 12:50.290
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

12:50.450 --> 12:52.530
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

12:52.530 --> 12:57.320
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

12:57.540 --> 12:59.160
♪The world mistakes me♪

12:59.160 --> 13:01.500
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

13:01.570 --> 13:02.760
♪As the storm approaches♪

13:02.760 --> 13:05.160
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

13:05.370 --> 13:07.090
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

13:07.090 --> 13:09.070
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

13:09.240 --> 13:10.990
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

13:10.990 --> 13:13.090
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

13:13.090 --> 13:14.560
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

13:14.560 --> 13:16.790
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

13:17.010 --> 13:18.210
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

13:18.210 --> 13:20.730
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

13:20.860 --> 13:22.570
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

13:22.570 --> 13:23.850
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

13:24.000 --> 13:25.420
♪My wish has finally come true♪

13:25.420 --> 13:26.460
♪To stay by your side♪

13:26.460 --> 13:28.380
♪In this fleeting world♪

13:28.550 --> 13:31.800
♪We are free and happy♪

13:35.800 --> 13:37.580
♪From a nobody♪

13:37.580 --> 13:39.480
♪To someone now famous♪

13:39.590 --> 13:41.020
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

13:41.020 --> 13:43.530
♪But I laugh at how
they cannot see through it all♪

13:43.630 --> 13:45.210
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

13:45.210 --> 13:47.280
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

13:47.490 --> 13:49.170
♪In this vast world♪

13:49.170 --> 13:51.170
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

13:51.320 --> 13:53.530
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

13:53.530 --> 13:55.120
♪Everything ends eventually♪

13:55.210 --> 13:56.710
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

13:56.710 --> 13:59.110
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

13:59.110 --> 14:00.820
♪No matter how time flies♪

14:00.820 --> 14:01.980
♪Even if the falling snow♪

14:01.980 --> 14:03.610
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

14:03.610 --> 14:04.650
♪All I want now♪

14:04.650 --> 14:06.750
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

14:06.750 --> 14:10.010
♪Year after year♪
